    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110258" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾱνός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>torch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				308
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ φανοῦ πορεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῖος</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τοιοῦτος οἷος ὁ ἥλιος;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					87
				</span></i>
			; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				48
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				40
			</span></i>; but prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				5.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
				10.251.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ φανῶν καὶ λαμπάδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
					18.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1159.59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾱνός</span></b>  (prob. a different word) is found in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				284
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				184
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				195
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
